izations can collapse, often in discussions of societal fragility.\",\"content_type\":\"documentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"bronze age collapse\",\"categories\":[\"World history\"],\"tags\":[\"bronze age\",\"sea peoples\",\"ancient history\",\"societal collapse\",\"eastern mediterranean\"],\"quote\":\"entertaining docu-series[0] describing the collapse of Bronze Age civilizations around the eastern Mediterranean\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"Ko4V3G4NqII\",\"title\":\"Macworld San Francisco 2000-The Mac OS X Introduction (Pt.1)\",\"channel\":\"JoshuaG\",\"summary\":\"An edited excerpt of Steve Jobs introducing Mac OS X at Macworld San Francisco in 2000. It covers the Aqua interface, Quartz graphics built on PDF, and the Classic, Carbon and Cocoa application environments.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters cite it as primary-source evidence of what Jobs actually said about Mac OS X's design, open-source kernel and NeXT-based transition.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"mac os x introduction\",\"categories\":[\"Tech pioneers & interviews\",\"GUI, HCI & interface history\",\"Operating systems & kernels\"],\"tags\":[\"steve jobs\",\"macworld 2000\",\"aqua\",\"cocoa\",\"nextstep\",\"apple history\"],\"quote\":\"In case you wanna procrastinate on a fascinating story about how Apple transitioned to NextStep's stack\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"Kp7FkLBRpKg\",\"title\":\"Julian Assange on Seth Rich\",\"channel\":\"Nieuwsuur\",\"summary\":\"A short clip from the Dutch program Nieuwsuur in which Julian Assange appears to suggest that murdered DNC staffer Seth Rich was the source of the WikiLeaks DNC emails.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN links it as the primary source for Assange's remarks hinting at Seth Rich as the leak source.\",\"content_type\":\"interview\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"assange on seth rich\",\"categories\":[\"US politics & elections\",\"Media, journalism & propaganda\",\"