ance\",\"categories\":[\"Music performance & songs\"],\"tags\":[\"one man band\",\"keyboards\",\"live performance\",\"midi\",\"music\"],\"quote\":\"This video of your live performance setup as a one-man band. Amazing.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"S94ETUiMZwQ\",\"title\":\"Westworld - Consciousness does not exist, Anthony Hopkins\",\"channel\":\"Dozenal Tauist\",\"summary\":\"A two-minute Westworld scene in which Robert Ford and Bernard Lowe discuss whether consciousness exists. Ford argues that the self is a fiction for hosts and humans alike.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN uses it in AI and consciousness debates as a memorable take on why general intelligence is hard to define.\",\"content_type\":\"other\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"consciousness and ai\",\"categories\":[\"Consciousness & cognition\",\"Film & TV clips\"],\"tags\":[\"westworld\",\"consciousness\",\"artificial general intelligence\",\"philosophy of mind\"],\"quote\":\"westworld (yes the tv-series) has the best explanation of why general intelligence is a hard problem to solve.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"S9kn8_oztsA\",\"title\":\"Ex Microsoft Employee tells secrets on why Windows 10 bugs exist 👨‍💻 - @Barnacules\",\"channel\":\"Barnacules Nerdgasm\",\"summary\":\"A former Microsoft SDET with 15 years on Windows gives his view on why Windows 10 updates keep shipping with bugs. He points to changes in how the company tests its software.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN cites it as a first-hand account of Microsoft's QA cuts and reliance on automated tests in threads about buggy Windows updates.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"windows quality assurance\",\"categories\":[\"Testing, debugging & developer tools\",\"Software practice, open source & careers\"],\"tags\":[\"windows 10\",\"microsoft\",\"qa layoffs\",\"software testing\",\"windows updates\"],\"quote\":\"Hear about it first hand from an ex windows software tester\",\"recommenders\