ounters with UFOs: BUSTED!\",\"channel\":\"Thunderf00t\",\"summary\":\"Thunderf00t critiques a 60 Minutes segment in which Navy pilots describe UFO encounters, arguing the footage has mundane explanations and has been debunked.\",\"why_hn\":\"Used by skeptics in UFO threads as a debunking of the Navy pilot videos.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"ufo footage debunking\",\"categories\":[\"Religion, belief & skepticism\",\"Media, journalism & propaganda\"],\"tags\":[\"ufo\",\"uap\",\"navy pilots\",\"debunking\",\"skepticism\"],\"quote\":\"a decent overview of it\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"VJ-p9qOhBv4\",\"title\":\"Cats in a Cat Cafe in Japan Reacting to an Earthquake - 994393\",\"channel\":\"RM Videos\",\"summary\":\"A one-minute clip from a cat cafe in Japan where sleeping cats wake and look around just before an earthquake begins shaking the room.\",\"why_hn\":\"Commenters use it in earthquake threads as an anecdote that animals may sense tremors seconds before humans, and occasionally as a joke about cat alarms.\",\"content_type\":\"other\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"animal earthquake detection\",\"categories\":[\"Animals & nature\",\"Geology & earth science\"],\"tags\":[\"cats\",\"earthquake\",\"japan\",\"animal behavior\"],\"quote\":\"you can clearly see the cats get alerted to something ~10 seconds before the shaking starts\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"VLHJUfgxEO4\",\"title\":\"OpenFlow @ Google - Urs Hoelzle, Google\",\"channel\":\"Open Networking Summit\",\"summary\":\"Urs Hoelzle, Google's SVP of infrastructure, gives the 2012 Open Networking Summit keynote on how Google adopted OpenFlow and software-defined networking in its own networks. The slides are linked in the description.\",\"why_hn\":\"Cited as a primary source for Google building its own switches and running OpenFlow in production.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":