lopment\",\"Creative coding & generative art\",\"Computer graphics & rendering\"],\"tags\":[\"voronoi\",\"html canvas\",\"javascript\",\"pointer pointer\",\"web development\"],\"quote\":\"Paul Irish did a breakdown of it quite a while ago\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ZH2wGpEZVgE\",\"title\":\"Design Club - Super Mario Bros: Level 1-1 - How Super Mario Mastered Level Design\",\"channel\":\"Extra History\",\"summary\":\"A Design Club episode that analyzes how Super Mario Bros. level 1-1 teaches players to play through level design alone, without text tutorials.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN cites it as the standard walkthrough of Mario's implicit teaching and as an example of hiding the tutorial inside the problem.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"level design\",\"categories\":[\"Game design\",\"Game history & retro gaming\"],\"tags\":[\"super mario bros\",\"level 1-1\",\"game design\",\"tutorials\",\"nintendo\"],\"quote\":\"To get a sense for this, watch this video [1] (from 7 years ago) walking through the design of level 1-1 of SMB.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ZI198eFghJk\",\"title\":\"Modernizing Compiler Design for Carbon Toolchain - Chandler Carruth - CppNow 2023\",\"channel\":\"CppNow\",\"summary\":\"Chandler Carruth's CppNow 2023 talk on modernizing compiler design for the Carbon toolchain, using data-oriented design and modern hardware assumptions. It covers lexing, parsing and compact data structures aimed at compiler performance.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a recent take on rethinking compiler architecture, and cited in discussions of flattened ASTs and fast lexers.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"advanced\",\"primary_topic\":\"compiler design\",\"categories\":[\"Compilers, interpreters & program analysis\",\"Software performance & optimization\",\"C, C++, Rust, Go & systems languages\"],\"tags\":[\"carbon language\",\"data-oriented design\",\"lexing\",\"parsing\",\"compiler perfor