ison and cites it when discussing why legacy automakers have more boxes and complexity than Tesla.\",\"content_type\":\"interview\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"automotive electrical architecture\",\"categories\":[\"Cars, EVs & motorcycles\",\"Repair, teardowns & right to repair\"],\"tags\":[\"tesla\",\"ecu\",\"teardown\",\"ev\",\"vehicle architecture\"],\"quote\":\"I'm not a Tesla fanboy but I didn't think it was biased.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ZTidn2dBYbY\",\"title\":\"David Hasselhoff - True Survivor (from Kung Fury)\",\"channel\":\"DavidHasselhoffVEVO\",\"summary\":\"The official music video for David Hasselhoff's synthwave track True Survivor, written for the film Kung Fury. It is an 80s-style pop song from the Kickstarter-funded movie.\",\"why_hn\":\"Mostly mentioned as a joke or a personal pick, including on a coding playlist thread.\",\"content_type\":\"music\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"synthwave music video\",\"categories\":[\"Music performance & songs\",\"Demoscene & retrocomputing\"],\"tags\":[\"david hasselhoff\",\"kung fury\",\"synthwave\",\"80s\",\"music video\"],\"quote\":null,\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ZW8gWgpptI8\",\"title\":\"Crafting A Tiny Open World: A Short Hike Postmortem\",\"channel\":\"GDC Festival of Gaming\",\"summary\":\"Adam Robinson-Yu's GDC 2020 talk on how he shelved a big project to prototype what became A Short Hike. He covers the solo development process and technical choices like a pixel shader over low-poly models.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN people cite it for solo-dev inspiration and for the rendering technique behind the game's look.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"indie game postmortem\",\"categories\":[\"Indie game development\",\"Game design\",\"Computer graphics & rendering\"],\"tags\":[\"a short hike\",\"gdc\",\"solo development\",\"pixel shader\",\"game design\"],\"quote\":\"You might want to watch this for inspira