    ",{\"vid\":\"aoag03mSuXQ\",\"title\":\"The Internet Was Weeks Away From Disaster And No One Knew\",\"channel\":\"Veritasium\",\"summary\":\"Veritasium tells the story of the XZ backdoor, how a patient attacker became maintainer and nearly compromised SSH on Linux systems. It also covers free software history and how encryption in SSH works.\",\"why_hn\":\"Cited as an accessible, documentary-style account of the XZ backdoor in supply chain security discussions.\",\"content_type\":\"documentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"xz backdoor\",\"categories\":[\"Security & hacking\",\"Linux & open-source ecosystems\",\"Cryptography\"],\"tags\":[\"xz\",\"supply chain attack\",\"linux\",\"ssh\",\"open source security\"],\"quote\":\"which was just fascinating to watch/listen\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"aolI_Rz0ZqY\",\"title\":\"So You Think You Know Git - FOSDEM 2024\",\"channel\":\"GitButler\",\"summary\":\"Scott Chacon's FOSDEM 2024 talk on lesser-known Git tips and tricks: useful config settings, older and newer commands, monorepo and big-repo features, and recent GitHub additions. It closes with why he is now building GitButler, followed by a Q&A.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters point to it as a well-regarded tour of newer, lesser-known Git features, and it is among the most-watched engineering talks of 2024.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"git workflows\",\"categories\":[\"Testing, debugging & developer tools\"],\"tags\":[\"git\",\"config\",\"monorepo\",\"rerere\",\"fosdem\",\"gitbutler\"],\"quote\":\"Great tech talk covering some of the newer lesser-known git features\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"aqqEYz38ens\",\"title\":\"High Res Wifi Signal Mapping\",\"channel\":\"CNLohr\",\"summary\":\"CNLohr maps Wi-Fi signal strength at high resolution by moving an ESP8266 on a CNC mill, then visualizes the 3D data in WebGL. The result shows interference patterns in space.\",\"why_hn\":\"Ci