nalism & propaganda\",\"Earth & energy (other)\",\"Labor, work & inequality\"],\"tags\":[\"john oliver\",\"last week tonight\",\"bob murray\",\"coal mining\",\"worker compensation\"],\"quote\":null,\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"awADEuv5vWY\",\"title\":\"How we can use light to see deep inside our bodies and brains | Mary Lou Jepsen\",\"channel\":\"TED\",\"summary\":\"Inventor Mary Lou Jepsen demonstrates using red light and sound to see inside the body and brain, aiming at tumor detection and neural activity measurement, and potentially a cheaper wearable MRI replacement.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN mentions it as a reference for Openwater's approach of light-based deep tissue imaging.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"optical medical imaging\",\"categories\":[\"Medicine & infectious disease\",\"Neuroscience & the brain\",\"Consumer devices & gadgets\"],\"tags\":[\"openwater\",\"near-infrared\",\"brain imaging\",\"holography\",\"ted talk\"],\"quote\":\"[1] is a good quick place to start and judge if you want to study their brainscanner in more depth.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ay-gqx18UTM\",\"title\":\"Windows 7 GUI slowness\",\"channel\":\"VooD\",\"summary\":\"A short demo showing slow 2D drawing in the Windows 7 GUI compared with XP. It attributes the slowdown to the display driver model lacking hardware accelerated GDI.\",\"why_hn\":\"Used as the reference example when people argue Windows UI responsiveness regressed after XP.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"windows gui performance\",\"categories\":[\"Software performance & optimization\",\"Operating systems & kernels\"],\"tags\":[\"windows 7\",\"gdi\",\"wddm\",\"ui latency\",\"windows xp\"],\"quote\":\"Here is a random link about it\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ay2uwtRO3QE\",\"title\":\"H3: Tiling the Earth with Hexagons\",\"channel\":\"Uber Engineering\",\"summary\":\"Uber Engineering's Jose