\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"bQfJi7rjuEk\",\"title\":\"Intelligence is not Enough | Bryan Cantrill | Monktoberfest 2023\",\"channel\":\"RedMonk Tech Events\",\"summary\":\"Bryan Cantrill's Monktoberfest 2023 talk takes on AI doomerism, weighing the theoretical existential risks against the reality on the ground. He takes a skeptical but thoughtful view of how to balance AI's potential against its risks.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a thoughtful Cantrill talk on embracing failure and curiosity in engineering, and as a skeptical counterpoint to AI doom narratives.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"ai risk and doomerism\",\"categories\":[\"AI safety, AGI & impact\",\"Tech pioneers & interviews\"],\"tags\":[\"ai\",\"doomerism\",\"bryan cantrill\",\"engineering culture\",\"skepticism\"],\"quote\":\"I saw Bryan Cantrill's talk on [Intelligence is Not Enough][0]\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"bS5P_LAqiVg\",\"title\":\"KUNG FURY Official Movie [HD]\",\"channel\":\"LaserUnicorns\",\"summary\":\"Kung Fury is a 30-minute crowd-funded 80s action comedy about a kung fu cop who travels back in time to kill Hitler, packed with retro tropes.\",\"why_hn\":\"Cited as a parody that crams in 80s movie tropes and as an example of the VHS aesthetic.\",\"content_type\":\"comedy\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"80s action parody\",\"categories\":[\"Satire & parody\",\"Film & TV clips\"],\"tags\":[\"kung fury\",\"parody\",\"kickstarter\",\"retro\",\"short film\"],\"quote\":\"They fit an impressive amount of 80's movie tropes into 30 minutes.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"b_T-eCToX1I\",\"title\":\"2016 LLVM Developers’ Meeting: D. Dunbar “A New Architecture for Building Software”\",\"channel\":\"LLVM\",\"summary\":\"Daniel Dunbar of Apple presents llbuild, a framework for building build systems, at the 2016 LLVM Developers' Meeting. He argues that the traditional way C compilers integrate with