ome\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ccRtIdlTqlU\",\"title\":\"James Gosling - Simula: a personal journey\",\"channel\":\"UiO Realfagsbiblioteket\",\"summary\":\"James Gosling gives a personal talk at the 50th anniversary seminar of Simula about using the language from 1974 and how it shaped his thinking. He explains how Simula's object model and coroutines influenced the design of Java.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN cites it as a first-hand source that Java's object model traces to Simula 67 rather than Smalltalk.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"simula and java history\",\"categories\":[\"Programming language design\",\"History of computing\",\"Software architecture & design\"],\"tags\":[\"simula\",\"james gosling\",\"java\",\"object-oriented programming\",\"programming history\"],\"quote\":\"Here's a more nuanced and impartial account of Simula by James Gosling, if you want to know more\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ceCOhdgRBoc\",\"title\":\"The Lobby P1: Young Friends of Israel l Al Jazeera Investigations\",\"channel\":\"Al Jazeera English\",\"summary\":\"The first part of an Al Jazeera undercover investigation into the Israel lobby in Britain, covering efforts to influence youth groups and the National Union of Students, including a smear campaign against its president.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters mostly cite it as an investigative documentary on lobbying and influence operations in UK politics, with some presenting it as a critical exposure of the lobby's tactics.\",\"content_type\":\"documentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"political lobbying\",\"categories\":[\"Geopolitics & foreign policy\",\"Media, journalism & propaganda\"],\"tags\":[\"israel lobby\",\"undercover investigation\",\"uk politics\",\"al jazeera\",\"student politics\"],\"quote\":\"There's a very interesting investigative documentary by Al Jazeera that shows how Israel funds and manages the Israeli lobby in the UK.\",\