e constraint-based methods he is using to compose a major work for pipe organ.\",\"why_hn\":\"Shared as a great talk showing Knuth's musical side and how he applies constraint techniques to composition.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"algorithmic music composition\",\"categories\":[\"Music theory, synthesis & production\",\"Tech pioneers & interviews\"],\"tags\":[\"donald knuth\",\"pipe organ\",\"constraints\",\"composition\",\"ccrma\"],\"quote\":\"Here's a great talk Knuth did at CCRMA @ Stanford last year, on writing pipe organ compositions using Constraint Based techniques.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"eakKfY5aHmY\",\"title\":\"amazing starlings murmuration (full HD) -www.keepturningleft.co.uk\",\"channel\":\"raisingmaggie\",\"summary\":\"Footage of a huge flock of starlings performing a murmuration, filmed by wildlife cameraman Dylan Winter. The flock moves in tightly coordinated shapes.\",\"why_hn\":\"Cited as a benchmark for leaderless swarm behavior that robots and drones could aim to match.\",\"content_type\":\"other\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"flocking behavior\",\"categories\":[\"Animals & nature\",\"Everyday physics & science demos\"],\"tags\":[\"starlings\",\"murmuration\",\"swarms\",\"drones\"],\"quote\":\"when drones can do this, drones will be cool\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ebeNeQFUMa0\",\"title\":\"Extraordinary Octopus Takes To Land | The Hunt | BBC Earth\",\"channel\":\"BBC Earth\",\"summary\":\"A BBC Earth clip from The Hunt showing an octopus species from northern Australia that leaves the water at low tide to hunt crabs on land.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN cites it as proof that some octopuses really do crawl out of the water to hunt.\",\"content_type\":\"documentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"octopus behavior\",\"categories\":[\"Animals & nature\"],\"tags\":[\"octopus\",\"amphibious\",\"bbc earth\",\"predation\",\"marine biology\"],\"quote\":\"Sir David Attenborough discusses the octopus here\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"ek0FrCaogcs\",\"title\":\"Onboard quadrocopter failsafe: flight after actuator failure\",\"channel\":\"Mark Mueller\",\"summary\":\"ETH Zurich researchers demonstrate a quadrocopter that keeps flying stably after losing a motor and propeller entirely, with the algorithm running onboard while a pilot flies it.\",\"why_hn\":\"It is the standard citation in drone and eVTOL threads for the claim that multirotors can survive a failed rotor with the right control algorithm.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"quadcopter fault tolerance\",\"categories\":[\"Robotics\",\"Aviation & aerospace engineering\"],\"tags\":[\"drones\",\"control systems\",\"quadrotor\",\"failsafe\",\"eth zurich\"],\"quote\":\"controlled, safe landings of quadrotors with a single failed motor have been demonstrated, see this ETH Zurich video from 2014\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"er416Ad3R1g\",\"title\":\"† Carpenter Brut † TURBO KILLER † Directed by Seth Ickerman † Official Video †\",\"channel\":\"Carpenter Brut\",\"summary\":\"The official video for Carpenter Brut's Turbo Killer, directed by Seth Ickerman, with psychedelic 1980s-styled visuals set to rock-leaning synthwave.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as an example of synthwave with striking retro visuals.\",\"content_type\":\"music\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"synthwave music video\",\"categories\":[\"Music performance & songs\"],\"tags\":[\"carpenter brut\",\"synthwave\",\"music video\",\"80s aesthetic\",\"seth ickerman\"],\"quote\":\"It's worth checking out if you're into rock-sounding synthwave with 80's themed psychedelic visuals.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"et8xNAc2ic8\",\"title\":\"dotJS 2012 - Brian Leroux - WTFJS\",\"channel\":\"dotconferences\",\"summary\":\"Brian Leroux's dotJS 2012 talk WTFJS is a quick, humorous tour of JavaScript's odd behaviors and