 glade\",\"gpu-driven rendering\",\"game engines\"],\"quote\":\"There’s a recent tech talk about it which is full of wizardry\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"jxNM4DGBRMU\",\"title\":\"What Really Happened at the Oroville Dam Spillway?\",\"channel\":\"Practical Engineering\",\"summary\":\"Practical Engineering summarizes the 2017 Oroville Dam spillway failure, explaining the engineering details behind the incident. It also discusses how operators and regulators failed to keep downstream residents safe.\",\"why_hn\":\"Pointed to as a detailed engineering walkthrough of a major dam incident, and as a parallel to software failures.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"dam failure engineering\",\"categories\":[\"Civil engineering & construction\"],\"tags\":[\"oroville dam\",\"spillway\",\"civil engineering\",\"infrastructure failure\",\"erosion\"],\"quote\":\"Practical engineering has a good detailed walkthrough of what happened at Oroville dam from an engineering perspective\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"jziQBWQxvok\",\"title\":\"Kefrens - Desert Dream - Amiga Demo (HD 50fps)\",\"channel\":\"RetroDemoScene\",\"summary\":\"Kefrens' Desert Dream, an Amiga demoscene production released at The Gathering in 1993, recaptured in HD at 50fps. It features code, music and graphics by a team of scene members.\",\"why_hn\":\"Brought up in Amiga threads as a classic example of what the demoscene achieved on old hardware.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"amiga demoscene\",\"categories\":[\"Demoscene & retrocomputing\",\"Music theory, synthesis & production\"],\"tags\":[\"amiga\",\"demoscene\",\"kefrens\",\"retro computing\",\"tracker music\"],\"quote\":null,\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":1.0},{\"vid\":\"k47u9tduwb8\",\"title\":\"I Sold Microwave Meals On Deliveroo\",\"channel\":\"Josh Pieters\",\"summary\":\"YouTuber Josh Pieters lists microwave meals on Deliveroo as if from a res